最下方前景处，横向排列着一排（共七张）麻将牌，从左至右依次清晰可见：“東”（黑色字）、“南”（黑色字）、“西”（黑色字）、“北”（黑色字）、“中”（红色字）、“發”（绿色字），最右侧还有一张背面的麻将牌。\n【光影与摄影风格】\n影棚正面柔光照明（Soft studio lighting），光线均匀地打在脸上，营造出通透的肤质，没有强烈的阴影。构图为中心构图，景别为近景/胸像。整体风格具有写实摄影的质感，带有一丝复古胶片或拍立得（Polaroid）的颗粒感和色调，高清晰度，8k分辨率。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 4, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [7], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 262], "pos": [933.514404296875, 422.93115234375], "widgets_values": [162723640184967, "randomize", 30, 4, "res_multistep", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 10, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 2, "label": "正面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "正面条件"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 3, "label": "负面条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "负面条件"}, {"name": "latent_image", "link": 6, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "随机种"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "步数"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "CFG"}, {"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "采样器"}, {"widget": {"name": "scheduler"}, "name": "scheduler", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "调度器"}, {"widget": {"name": "denoise"}, "name": "denoise", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "降噪"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "KSampler", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KSampler"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "li